    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. I'm a bit worried about how that Engineering part looks in the draft though. If we lead with \"significant quarter-over-quarter increase,\" the Board is going to go straight to the negative and start grilling us on why things are falling apart. \n\nCan we rephrase that section? I want to frame the Engineer numbers in a way that sounds more like routine or predictable movement rather than a \"spike\" or a crisis. Maybe something that blends it in more with the other departments so it doesn't stand out so much in the summary?",
