      "content": "Focusing on the overall company average provides a much stronger, unified message of operational health. Stating that the total turnover rate of 7.4% remains manageable and consistent with industry benchmarks powerfully frames the organization as stable. This approach effectively smooths over departmental variations by emphasizing the resilient aggregate performance across the entire business. This generalized stability narrative is highly reassuring for a Board prioritizing workforce endurance.",
